{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-633395048762901477 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=633395048729281509&sectionId=633395048762901477)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","label":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","default":"<p>Birthday memories change as we grow, which makes photographs from different stages of life especially meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>children</strong>, you could choose a photo from their favorite birthday party.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>teenagers</strong>, consider a photograph with their closest friends.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>adults</strong>, a milestone birthday or family celebration can make a meaningful keepsake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>grandparents</strong>, a photograph surrounded by children and grandchildren can become a wonderful reminder of the people who make their birthdays special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is no age limit to preserving a birthday memory.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/072a4bb4-c008-4c8f-9cd8-a8605b491532.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","label":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","default":"Build It Together"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","label":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","default":"<p>Memobrick can also turn the birthday memory into another shared experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Family members can build the mosaic together. Friends can work on it as a group. Parents and children can create it together while talking about the celebration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph represents one memory, while building the Memobrick creates another.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That makes the finished piece even more meaningful.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","label":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","default":"Choose the Right Size for the Birthday Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","label":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","default":"<p>The size of your Memobrick should match the photograph you want to use.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a close up portrait of one person, smaller sizes such as <strong>10x10 or 16x16</strong> can work well because the face takes up a large portion of the image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For family birthday photographs or group pictures, consider <strong>20x20 or larger</strong>. More space allows additional faces and details to be represented more clearly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If your birthday photograph includes a large group, detailed decorations, or other important elements, a larger size can provide a better result.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One of the beautiful things about birthdays is that they happen every year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family could even turn birthday photographs into an ongoing tradition. Choose a favorite photograph each year and create a Memobrick from it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Over time, these keepsakes can become a visual timeline of a person's life, showing how children grow, families change, and new memories are created.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What starts as a single birthday gift could eventually become a collection of memories that tells an entire story.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","label":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","default":"<p>A birthday may only last one day, but the memories created during it can last much longer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The cake will eventually be gone, the decorations will come down, and the celebration will end. But a favorite photograph can continue telling the story of that special day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turn that photograph into a personalized Memobrick and give the memory a place where it can be seen, built, and enjoyed for years to come.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Because some birthdays deserve to be remembered long after the candles are gone.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5WRTHxxAW_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5WRTHxxAW_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaron_M._Excellent_customer_service_The_design_team_did_an_excellent_job_and_we_are_so_pleased_to_have_a_precious_family_picture_transformed_into_such_a_cool_art_form..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF6Lo7VUvD_text","label":"ggF6Lo7VUvD_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtuuWlj0zd_text","label":"ggtuuWlj0zd_text","default":"<p>Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY2-_puGNx_text","label":"ggY2-_puGNx_text","default":"<p>Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxDqr-JU7h_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggxDqr-JU7h_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Hilary_S._Super_easy_to_put_together._Comes_with_a_tool_to_use._But_I_placed_them_all_1_by_1._Reminded_me_alot_of_doing_diamond_art_pictures..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo4vaccT-e_text","label":"ggo4vaccT-e_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW1i1A5lVQ_text","label":"ggW1i1A5lVQ_text","default":"<p>Hilarty S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggz_XsIoGgb_text","label":"ggz_XsIoGgb_text","default":"<p>Super easy to put together. Comes with a tool to use. But I placed them all 1 by 1. Reminded me alot of doing diamond art pictures.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5HW0yu67J_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5HW0yu67J_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPla-Vf5GO_text","label":"ggPla-Vf5GO_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBuFCLS1iX_text","label":"ggBuFCLS1iX_text","default":"<p>Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguCAvQhZyo_text","label":"gguCAvQhZyo_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGl8P633Q_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggnGl8P633Q_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Candice_L._I_split_the_photo_in_half_so_I_could_get_2_of_the_60x20_so_I_could_fill_my_wall_more_and_its_turned_out_AMAZING.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyZS4Dlpup_text","label":"ggyZS4Dlpup_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0Nj6LwyOB_text","label":"gg0Nj6LwyOB_text","default":"<p>Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcFQ5vYa63_text","label":"ggcFQ5vYa63_text","default":"<p>I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCVSGvY6e_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggaCVSGvY6e_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/John_R._It_was_a_fun_relaxing_task._My_wife_and_I_are_thrilled_to_have_our_wedding_photo_in_such_an_interesting_style.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-rnoHvIgX_text","label":"gg-rnoHvIgX_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR74GPgOlK_text","label":"ggR74GPgOlK_text","default":"<p>Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4U7TYBCZ_text","label":"ggx4U7TYBCZ_text","default":"Replace this text with your content"}],
